 colspan=\"2\">\n<details>\n<summary>  Batafsil</summary>\n<br>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Klaviatura bilan erkin yurasiz yoki tayyor marshrut boʻylab siljiysiz. Fizika haqiqiy: devordan oʻtib boʻlmaydi, zinadan koʻtarilasiz.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Burchakdagi shisha panelda sakkizta xonaning <strong>jonli 3D koʻrinishi</strong> — har biri alohida kameradan sekin aylanib turadi, bosasiz va oʻsha yerda paydo boʻlasiz</li>\n<li>Toʻrt til: oʻzbek (lotin/kirill), rus, ingliz — kirishdagi elektron trubunadan tanlanadi</li>\n<li>Devordagi ekranlarda GitHub profilim jonli koʻrinadi</li>\n<li>Fikr qoldirish formasi ham 3D — DOM emas, sahnaning ichida</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td width=\"60\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🩺</h3><a id=\"user-content--1\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🩺\" href=\"#-1\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div></td><td>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/AbduazizBobomalikovNode/tibsim\">TibSim</a></strong> — tibbiyot texnikasi fani uchun virtual laboratoriya\n<sub><code>TypeScript</code> · <code>3D</code> · <code>PWA</code></sub></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">\n<details>\n<summary>  Batafsil</summary>\n<br>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tibbiyot texnikasini kitobdan oʻrganib boʻlmaydi — qurilmani ishlatib koʻrish kerak. TibSim shuning uchun: <strong>oʻn modul</strong>, har biri alohida qurilma yoki jarayon.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Internetsiz ham ochiladi (PWA), oʻzbek va rus tillarida. Talaba tugmani bosadi, natijani darhol koʻradi.</p>\n</details>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td width=\"60\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🤖</h3><a id=\"user-content--2\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🤖\" href=\"#-2\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div></td><td>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/AbduazizBobomalikovNode/tg-ai-analyzer\">tg-ai-analyzer</a></strong> — Telegram chatlari uchun AI agent\n<sub><code>Python</code> · <code>MTProto</code> · <code>Gemini / DeepSeek</code></sub></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">\n<details>\n<summary>  Batafsil</summary>\n<br>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Telegram arxivingizda minglab xabar bor va ularning ichidan kerakligini topib boʻlmaydi. Agent MTProto orqali arxivga kiradi, xabarlarni tahlil qiladi, qidiradi va xulosa chiqaradi.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Bot API bilan boshqariladi, model sifatida Gemini yoki DeepSeek ishlaydi.</p>\n</details>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td width=\"60\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">⚡</h3><a id=\"user-content--3\" class=\"anchor\" aria-